  Derived files: the exports, slices, snapshots and elaboration data of Lean's
  core library (Init) under tests/ (the files named *.ndjson,
  *.elab.ndjson and the snapshots under tests/snapshots/), written by Lean and
  lean4export from Lean's sources; the Lean files under tests/ that restate
  Lean's theorems for comparison; and the passages of Lean's sources quoted in
  source comments and in docs/ to say which Lean function a LeanForth word
  follows.

